# Protect image assets

**Never edit, overwrite, re-export, compress, resize, convert, or delete files in `assets/img/`** (or any other image/binary media in this repo).

This includes:
- Do not use Write, StrReplace, or Delete on `.jpg`, `.jpeg`, `.png`, `.gif`, `.webp`, `.pdf`, `.tiff`, or similar binary files
- Do not run ImageMagick, `convert`, `sips`, `ffmpeg`, or other tools that write to those paths
- Do not enable or trigger plugins/workflows that overwrite source images

Allowed:
- Reference image paths in HTML, Liquid, Markdown, CSS, or JS (display size via CSS only)
- Point `src` / `data-zoom-src` at existing files
- Read image metadata to answer questions

If an image needs replacing or re-exporting, **ask the user to do it** and only update code references if they request it.

High-quality sources for news photos: prefer `leonie_athens_hq.jpeg`, `leonie_neurips_hq.jpeg`, and user-provided originals — never substitute or regenerate them.
